((last modification: 2004 september 28th)) 
TP
((1. akattiṇi iyal))
 
## 	{SA TP1i} 	{N akatt-01} 	 
1.	kikkiḷi mutalā+ peruntiṇi iṟuvāy 
2.	muṟpaṭa+ kiḷanta eḻu tiṇi eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TP2i} 	{N akatt-02} 	 
1.	avaṟṟuḷ, 
2.	naṭuvaṇ aintiṇi naṭuvaṇatu oḻiya 
3.	paṭu tiri viyam pāttiya paṇpē. 

 
## 	{SA TP3i} 	{N akatt-03} 	 
1.	mutal karu uripporuḷ eṉṟa mūṉṟē 
2.	nuvalum kāli muṟi ciṟantaṉavē 
3.	pāṭaluḷ payinṟavi nāṭum kāli. 

 
## 	{SA TP4i} 	{N akatt-04} 	 
1.	mutal eṉappaṭuvatu nilam poḻutu iraṇṭiṉ 
2.	iyalpu eṉa moḻipa iyalpu uṇarntōrē. 

 
## 	{SA TP5i} 	{N akatt-05} 	 
1.	māyōṉ mēya kāṭu uṟi ulakamum 
2.	cēyōṉ mēya mi vari ulakamum 
3.	vēntaṉ mēya tīm puṉal ulakamum 
4.	varuṇaṉ mēya peru maṇal ulakamum 
5.	mulli kuṟiñci marutam neytal eṉa+ 
6.	colliya muṟiyāṉ collavumpaṭumē. 

 
## 	{SA TP6i} 	{N akatt-06} 	 
1.	kār um māli ~um mulli. 

 
## 	{SA TP7i} 	{N akatt-07} 	 
1.	kuṟiñci, 
2.	kūtir yāmam eṉmaṉār pulavar. 

 
## 	{SA TP8i} 	{N akatt-08} 	 
1.	paṉi etir paruvamum urittu eṉa moḻipa. 

 
## 	{SA TP9i} 	{N akatt-09} 	 
1.	vikaṟi viṭiyal marutam. 

 
## 	{SA TP10i} 	{N akatt-10} 	 
1.	eṟpāṭu, 
2.	neytal ātal mey peṟa+ tōṉṟum. 

 
## 	{SA TP11i} 	{N akatt-11} 	 
1.	naṭuvunili+ tiṇiyē naṇpakal vēṉiloṭu 
2.	muṭivu nili maruṅkiṉ muṉṉiya neṟittē. 

 
## 	{SA TP12i} 	{N akatt-12} 	 
1.	piṉpaṉitāṉum urittu eṉa moḻipa. 

 
## 	{SA TP13i} 	{N akatt-13} 	 
1.	iru vaki+ pirivum nili peṟa+ tōṉṟalum 
2.	uriyatu ākum eṉmaṉār pulavar. 

 
## 	{SA TP14i} 	{N akatt-14} 	 
1.	tiṇi mayakkuṟutalum kaṭi nili ilavē 
2.	nilaṉ oruṅku mayaṅkutal ila eṉa moḻipa 
3.	pulaṉ naṉku uṇarnta pulamiyōrē. 

 
## 	{SA TP15i} 	{N akatt-15} 	 
1.	uripporuḷ allaṉa mayaṅkavum peṟumē. 

 
## 	{SA TP16i} 	{N akatt-16} 	 
1.	puṇartal pirital iruttal iraṅkal 
2.	ūṭal avaṟṟiṉ nimittam eṉṟivi 
3.	tērum kāli tiṇikku uripporuḷē. 

 
## 	{SA TP17i} 	{N akatt-17} 	 
1.	koṇṭu talikkaḻitalum pirintu avaṇ iraṅkalum 
2.	uṇṭu eṉa moḻipa ōr iṭattāṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TP18i} 	{N akatt-18} 	 
1.	kalanta poḻutum kāṭciyum aṉṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TP19i} 	{N akatt-19} 	 
1.	mutal eṉappaṭuvatu āyiru vakittē. 

 
## 	{SA TP20i} 	{N akatt-20} 	 
1.	teyvam uṇāvē mā maram puḷ paṟi 
2.	ceyti yāḻiṉ pakutiyoṭu tokii 
3.	av vaki piṟavum karu eṉa moḻipa. 

 
## 	{SA TP21i} 	{N akatt-21} 	 
1.	en nila maruṅkiṉ pū ~um puḷ= um 
2.	an nilam poḻutoṭu vārā āyiṉum 
3.	vanta nilattiṉ payatta ākum. 

 
## 	{SA TP22i} 	{N akatt-22} 	 
1.	peyar um viṉi ~um eṉṟu* āy iru vakiya 
2.	tiṇitoṟum marīiya tiṇi nili+ peyar ē. 

 
## 	{SA TP23i} 	{N akatt-23} 	 
1.	āyar vēṭṭuvar āṭūu+ tiṇi+ peyar 
2.	āvayiṉ varūum kiḻavarum uḷarē. 

 
## 	{SA TP24i} 	{N akatt-24} 	 
1.	ēṉōr maruṅkiṉum eṇṇum kāli 
2.	āṉā vakiya tiṇi nili+ peyarē. 

 
## 	{SA TP25i} 	{N akatt-25} 	 
1.	aṭiyōr pāṅkiṉum viṉivalar pāṅkiṉum 
2.	kaṭivari ila puṟattu eṉmaṉār pulavar. 

 
## 	{SA TP26i} 	{N akatt-26} 	 
1.	ēval marapiṉ ēṉōrum uriyar 
2.	ākiya nilimi avarum aṉṉar. 

 
## 	{SA TP27i} 	{N akatt-27} 	 
1.	ōtal pakiyē tūtu ivi pirivē. 

 
## 	{SA TP28i} 	{N akatt-28} 	 
1.	avaṟṟuḷ, 
2.	ōtalum tūtum uyarntōr mēṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TP29i} 	{N akatt-29} 	 
1.	tāṉē cēṟalum taṉṉoṭu civaṇiya 
2.	ēṉōr cēṟalum vēntaṉ mēṟṟē. 

 
## 	{SA TP30i} 	{N akatt-30} 	 
1.	mēviya ciṟappiṉ ēṉōr paṭimiya 
2.	mulli mutalā+ colliya muṟiyāṉ 
3.	piḻittatu piḻiyātu ākal vēṇṭiyum 
4.	iḻitta oṇ poruḷ muṭiyavum pirivē. 

 
## 	{SA TP31i} 	{N akatt-31} 	 
1.	mēlōr muṟimi nālvarkkum urittē. 

 
## 	{SA TP32i} 	{N akatt-32} 	 
1.	maṉṉar pāṅkiṉ piṉṉōr ākupa. 

 
## 	{SA TP33i} 	{N akatt-33} 	 
1.	uyarntōrkku uriya ōttiṉāṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TP34i} 	{N akatt-34} 	 
1.	vēntu viṉi iyaṟki vēntaṉ orīiya 
2.	ēṉōr maruṅkiṉum eytu iṭaṉ uṭittē. 

 
## 	{SA TP35i} 	{N akatt-35} 	 
1.	poruḷvayiṉ piritalum avarvayiṉ urittē. 

 
## 	{SA TP36i} 	{N akatt-36} 	 
1.	uyarntōr poruḷvayiṉ oḻukkattāṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TP37i} 	{N akatt-37} 	 
1.	munnīr vaḻakkam makaṭūuvoṭu illi. 

 
## 	{SA TP38i} 	{N akatt-38} 	 
1.	ettiṇi maruṅkiṉum makaṭūu maṭalmēl 
2.	poṟpuṭi neṟimi iṉmiyāṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TP39i} 	{N akatt-39} 	 
1.	taṉṉum avaṉum avaḷum cuṭṭi 
2.	maṉṉum nimittam moḻi+ poruḷ teyvam 
3.	naṉmi tīmi accam cārtal eṉṟu 
4.	aṉṉa piṟavum avaṟṟoṭu tokii 
5.	muṉṉiya kālam mūṉṟuṭaṉ viḷakki 
6.	tōḻi tēettum kaṇṭōr pāṅkiṉum 
7.	pōkiya tiṟattu naṟṟāy pulampalum 
8.	ākiya kiḷaviyum av vaḻi uriya. 

 
## 	{SA TP40i} 	{N akatt-40} 	 
1.	ēma+ pērūr+ cēriyum curattum 
2.	tāmē cellum tāyarum uḷarē. 

 
## 	{SA TP41i} 	{N akatt-41} 	 
1.	ayalōr āyiṉum akaṟci mēṟṟē. 

 
## 	{SA TP42i} 	{N akatt-42} 	 
1.	talivarum viḻuma nili eṭuttu urippiṉum 
2.	pōkkaṟkaṇṇum viṭuttaṟkaṇṇum 
3.	nīkkaliṉ vanta tam uṟu viḻumamum 
4.	vāymi ~um poymmi ~um kaṇṭōṟ cuṭṭi+ 
5.	tāy nili nōkki+ talippeyarttu+ koḷiṉum 
6.	nōy mika+ peruki+ taṉ neñcu kaluḻntōḷi 
7.	aḻintatu kaḷi eṉa moḻintatu kūṟi 
8.	vaṉpuṟi neruṅki vantataṉ tiṟattoṭu 
9.	eṉṟu ivi ellām iyalpuṟa nāṭiṉ 
10.	oṉṟi+ tōṉṟum tōḻi mēṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TP43i} 	{N akatt-43} 	 
1.	poḻutum āṟum uṭku vara+ tōṉṟi 
2.	vaḻuviṉ ākiya kuṟṟam kāṭṭalum 
3.	ūratu cārpum cellum tēyamum 
4.	ārva neñcamoṭu ceppiya vaḻiyiṉum 
5.	puṇarntōr pāṅkiṉ puṇarnta neñcamoṭu 
6.	aḻintu etir kūṟi viṭuppiṉum āṅka+ 
7.	tāy nili kaṇṭu taṭuppiṉum viṭuppiṉum 
8.	cēy nilikku akaṉṟōr celaviṉum varaviṉum 
9.	kaṇṭōr moḻital kaṇṭatu eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TP44i} 	{N akatt-44} 	 
1.	oṉṟā+ tamariṉum paruvattu* um curattu* um 
2.	oṉṟiya moḻiyoṭu valippiṉum viṭuppiṉum 
3.	iṭi+ cura maruṅkiṉ avaḷ tamar eyti+ 
4.	kaṟpoṭu puṇarnta kuvi uḷappaṭa 
5.	a+ pāl paṭṭa oru tiṟattāṉum 
6.	nāḷatu ciṉmi ~um iḷamiyatu arumi ~um 
7.	tāḷāṉ pakkam um takutiyatu amiti ~um 
8.	iṉmiyatu iḷivu* um uṭimiyatu uyarcci ~um 
9.	aṉpiṉatu akalam um akaṟciyatu arumi ~um 
10.	oṉṟāy+ poruḷvayiṉ ūkkiya pāliṉum 
11.	vāyiṉum kiyiṉum vakutta pakkamoṭu 
12.	ūtiyam karutiya oru tiṟattāṉum 
13.	pukaḻ um māṉam um eṭuttu vaṟpuṟuttal um 
14.	tūtu iṭiyiṭṭa vakiyiṉāṉum 
15.	āki+ tōṉṟum pāṅkōr pāṅkiṉum 
16.	mūṉṟaṉ pakuti ~um maṇṭilattu arumi ~um 
17.	tōṉṟal cāṉṟa māṟṟōr mēṉmi ~um 
18.	pācaṟi+ pulampal um muṭinta kālattu+ 
19.	pākaṉoṭu virumpiya viṉittiṟa vakiyiṉum 
20.	kāvaṟ pāṅkiṉ āṅkōr pakkam um 
21.	parattiyiṉ akaṟciyiṉ parintōṭ kuṟuki 
22.	irattal um teḷittal um eṉa iru vakiyoṭu 
23.	uri+ tiṟa nāṭṭam kiḻavōṉ mēṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TP45i} 	{N akatt-45} 	 
1.	eñciyōrkkum eñcutal ilavē. 

 
## 	{SA TP46i} 	{N akatt-46} 	 
1.	nikaḻntatu niṉittaṟku ētuvum ākum. 

 
## 	{SA TP47i} 	{N akatt-47} 	 
1.	nikaḻntatu kūṟi niliyalum tiṇiyē. 

 
## 	{SA TP48i} 	{N akatt-48} 	 
1.	marapunili tiriyā māṭciya āki 
2.	viravum poruḷum viravum eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TP49i} 	{N akatt-49} 	 
1.	uḷḷuṟi uvamam ēṉi uvamam eṉa+ 
2.	taḷḷātu ākum tiṇi uṇar vakiyē. 

 
## 	{SA TP50i} 	{N akatt-50} 	 
1.	uḷḷuṟi teyvam oḻintati nilam eṉa+ 
2.	koḷḷum eṉpa kuṟi aṟintōrē. 

 
## 	{SA TP51i} 	{N akatt-51} 	 
1.	uḷḷuṟuttu itaṉoṭu ottu+ poruḷ muṭika eṉa 
2.	uḷḷuṟuttu iṟuvati uḷḷuṟi uvamam. 

 
## 	{SA TP52i} 	{N akatt-52} 	 
1.	ēṉi uvamam tāṉ uṇar vakittē. 

 
## 	{SA TP53i} 	{N akatt-53} 	 
1.	kāmam cālā iḷamiyōḷ vayiṉ 
2.	ēmam cālā iṭumpi eyti 
3.	naṉmi ~um tīmi ~um eṉṟu iru tiṟattāṉ 
4.	taṉṉoṭu* um avaḷoṭu* um tarukkiya puṇarttu 
5.	col etir peṟāaṉ colli iṉpuṟal 
6.	pulli+ tōṉrum kikkiḷi+ kuṟippu* ē. 

 
## 	{SA TP54i} 	{N akatt-54} 	 
1.	ēṟiya maṭal tiṟam iḷami tīr tiṟam 
2.	tēṟutal oḻinta kāmattu miku tiṟam 
3.	mikka kāmattu miṭaloṭu tokii 
4.	ceppiya nāṉkum peruntiṇi+ kuṟippē. 

 
## 	{SA TP55i} 	{N akatt-55} 	 
1.	muṉṉiya nāṉkum muṉṉataṟku eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TP56i} 	{N akatt-56} 	 
1.	nāṭaka vaḻakkiṉ um ulakiyal vaḻakkiṉ um 
2.	pāṭal cāṉṟa pulaṉeṟi vaḻakkam 
3.	kali ~ē paripāṭṭu āy iru pāviṉ um 
4.	uriyatu ākum eṉmaṉār pulavar. 

 
## 	{SA TP57i} 	{N akatt-57} 	 
1.	makkaḷ nutaliya akaṉ aim^ tiṇi ~um 
2.	cuṭṭi oruvar+ peyar koḷa+ peṟāar. 

 
## 	{SA TP58i} 	{N akatt-58} 	 
1.	puṟattiṇi maruṅkiṉ poruntiṉ allatu 
2.	akattiṇi maruṅkiṉ aḷavutal ilavē. 


((2. puṟattiṇi iyal))
 
## 	{SA TP59i} 	{N puRat-01} 	 
1.	akattiṇi maruṅkiṉ aril tapa uṇarntōr 
2.	puṟattiṇi ilakkaṇam tiṟappaṭa+ kiḷappiṉ 
3.	veṭci tāṉ ē kuṟiñciyatu puṟaṉ ē 
4.	uṭku vara+ tōṉṟum īr-ēḻ tuṟittu* ē. 

 
## 	{SA TP60i} 	{N puRat-02} 	 
1.	vēntu viṭu muṉiñar vēṟṟu+ pula+ kaḷaviṉ 
2.	ā tantu ōmpal mēvaṟṟu ākum. 

 
## 	{SA TP61i} 	{N puRat-03} 	 
1.	paṭi iyaṅku aravam pākkattu viricci 
2.	puṭi keṭa+ pōkiya celavē puṭi keṭa 
3.	oṟṟiṉ ākiya vēyē veyppuṟam 
4.	muṟṟiṉ ākiya puṟattu iṟi muṟṟiya 
5.	ūr koli ā kōḷ pūcal māṟṟē 
6.	nōy iṉṟu uyttal nuvalvaḻi+ tōṟṟam 
7.	tantu niṟi pātīṭu uṇṭāṭṭu koṭi eṉa 
8.	vanta īr-ēḻ vakiyiṟṟu ākum. 

 
## 	{SA TP62i} 	{N puRat-04} 	 
1.	maṟam kaṭikkūṭṭiya kuṭinili ciṟanta 
2.	koṟṟavi niliyum a+ tiṇi+ puṟaṉ ē. 

 
## 	{SA TP63i} 	{N puRat-05} 	 
1.	veṟi aṟi ciṟappiṉ vev vāy vēlaṉ 
2.	veṟiyāṭṭu ayarnta kāntaḷum uṟu paki 
3.	vēntiṭi terital vēṇṭi ēntu pukaḻ 
4.	pōnti vēmpē ār eṉa varūum 
5.	mā perum tāṉiyar malinta pūvum 
6.	vāṭa vaḷḷi vayavar ēttiya 
7.	ōṭā+ kaḻal-nili uḷappaṭa ōṭā 
8.	uṭal vēntu aṭukkiya uṉṉa niliyum 
9.	māyōṉ mēya maṉ peruñ ciṟappiṉ 
10.	tāvā viḻu+ pukaḻ+ pūvi niliyum 
11.	ār amar ōṭṭalum ā peyarttu+ tarutalum 
12.	cīr cāl vēntaṉ ciṟappu eṭuttu urittalum 
13.	tali+ tāḷ neṭumoḻi taṉṉoṭu puṇarttalum 
14.	aṉikku uri marapiṉatu karanti. aṉṟiyum 
15.	varu tār tāṅkal vāḷ vāyttu+ kaviḻtal eṉṟu 
16.	iru vaki+ paṭṭa piḷḷi niliyum 
17.	vāḷ malintu eḻuntōṉi makiḻntu paṟi tūṅka 
18.	nāṭu avaṟku aruḷiya piḷḷiyāṭṭum 
19.	kāṭci kālkōḷ nīrppaṭi naṭutal 
20.	cīrtta marapiṉ perumpaṭi vāḻttal eṉṟu 
21.	iru-mūṉṟu marapiṉ kalloṭu puṇara+ 
22.	collappaṭṭa eḻu-mūṉṟu tuṟittē. 

 
## 	{SA TP64i} 	{N puRat-06} 	 
1.	vañcitāṉē mulliyatu puṟaṉē 
2.	eñcā maṇ naci vēntaṉi vēntaṉ 
3.	añcu taka+ tali+ ceṉṟu aṭal kuṟittaṉṟē. 

 
## 	{SA TP65i} 	{N puRat-07} 	 
1.	iyaṅku paṭi aravam eri parantu eṭuttal 
2.	vayaṅkal eytiya perumiyāṉum 
3.	koṭuttal eytiya koṭimiyāṉum 
4.	aṭuttu ūrntu aṭṭa koṟṟattāṉum 
5.	mārāyam peṟṟa neṭumoḻiyāṉum 
6.	poruḷiṉṟu uytta pērāṇ pakkamum 
7.	varu vici+ puṉali+ kaṟ ciṟi pōla 
8.	oruvaṉ tāṅkiya perumiyāṉum 
9.	piṇṭam mēya peruñcōṟṟu niliyum 
10.	veṉṟōr viḷakkamum tōṟṟōr tēyvum 
11.	kuṉṟā+ ciṟappiṉ koṟṟa vaḷḷiyum 
12.	aḻi paṭi taṭṭōr taḻiñciyoṭu tokii 
13.	kaḻi peruñ ciṟappiṉ tuṟi patiṉmūṉṟē. 

 
## 	{SA TP66i} 	{N puRat-08} 	 
1.	uḻiñitāṉē marutattu+ puṟaṉē 
2.	muḻu mutal araṇam muṟṟalum kōṭalum 
3.	aṉi neṟi marapiṟṟu ākum eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TP67i} 	{N puRat-09} 	 
1.	atuvētāṉum iru-nāl vakittē. 

 
## 	{SA TP68i} 	{N puRat-10} 	 
1.	koḷḷār tēem kuṟitta koṟṟamum 
2.	uḷḷiyatu muṭikkum vēntaṉatu ciṟappum 
3.	tol eyiṟku ivartalum tōlatu perukkamum 
4.	akattōṉ celvamum aṉṟiyum muraṇiya 
5.	puṟattōṉ aṇaṅkiya pakkamum tiṟal paṭa 
6.	oru tāṉ maṇṭiya kuṟumi ~um uṭaṉṟōr 
7.	varu paki pēṇār ār eyil uḷappaṭa 
8.	collappaṭṭa nāl-iru vakittē. 

 
## 	{SA TP69i} 	{N puRat-11} 	 
1.	kuṭiyum vāḷum nāḷkōḷ aṉṟi 
2.	maṭi ami ēṇimici mayakkamum kaṭii+ 
3.	cuṟṟu amar oḻiya veṉṟu ki+ koṇṭu 
4.	muṟṟiya mutirvum aṉṟi muṟṟiya 
5.	akattōṉ vīḻnta nocciyum maṟṟu ataṉ 
6.	puṟattōṉ vīḻnta putumiyāṉum 
7.	nīr+ ceru vīḻnta pāciyum atāaṉṟu 
