## 	{SA TP213i} 	{N poruL-21} 	 
1.	uyarntōr kiḷavi vaḻakkoṭu puṇartaliṉ 
2.	vaḻakku vaḻippaṭutal ceyyuṭku+ kaṭaṉ ē. 

 
## 	{SA TP214i} 	{N poruL-22} 	 
1.	aṟa+ kaḻivu uṭiyaṉa poruḷ+ payam paṭa variṉ 
2.	vaḻakku* eṉa vaḻaṅkal um paḻittaṉṟu eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TP215i} 	{N poruL-23} 	 
1.	mikka poruḷiṉuḷ poruḷ vaki puṇarkka 
2.	nāṇu+ talippiriyā nalvaḻi+ paṭuttē. 

 
## 	{SA TP216i} 	{N poruL-24} 	 
1.	muṟippeyar maruṅkiṉ keḻutaki+ potu+ col 
2.	nilikku uri marapiṉ iru vīṟṟum urittē. 

 
## 	{SA TP217i} 	{N poruL-25} 	 
1.	tāyattiṉ aṭiyā īya+ cellā 
2.	viṉivayiṉ taṅkā vīṟṟu+ koḷappaṭā 
3.	em eṉa varūum kiḻami+ tōṟṟam 
4.	allāvāyiṉum pulluva uḷavē. 

 
## 	{SA TP218i} 	{N poruL-26} 	 
1.	oru pāl kiḷavi eṉi+ pāṟkaṇ= um 
2.	varu vaki tāṉē vaḻakku eṉa moḻipa. 

 
## 	{SA TP219i} 	{N poruL-27} 	 
1.	ellā uyirkkum iṉpam eṉpatu 
2.	tāṉ amarntu varūum mēvaṟṟu ākum. 

 
## 	{SA TP220i} 	{N poruL-28} 	 
1.	paratti vāyil nālvarkkum urittē 
2.	nila+ tiripu iṉṟu aḵtu eṉmaṉār pulavar. 

 
## 	{SA TP221i} 	{N poruL-29} 	 
1.	orutali urimi vēṇṭiṉum makaṭūu+ 
2.	pirital accam uṇmiyāṉum 
3.	ampalum alarum kaḷavu veḷippaṭukkum eṉṟu 
4.	añca vanta āṅku iru vakiyiṉum 
5.	nōkkoṭu vanta iṭiyūṟu poruḷiṉum 
6.	pōkkum varivum maṉivikaṇ tōṉṟum. 

 
## 	{SA TP222i} 	{N poruL-30} 	 
1.	varutta mikuti cuṭṭum kāli 
2.	urittu eṉa moḻipa vāḻkkiyuḷ irakkam. 

 
## 	{SA TP223i} 	{N poruL-31} 	 
1.	maṉivi uyarvum kiḻavōṉ paṇivum 
2.	niṉiyum kāli pulaviyuḷ uriya. 

 
## 	{SA TP224i} 	{N poruL-32} 	 
1.	nikaḻ taki maruṅkiṉ vēṭki mikutiyiṉ 
2.	pukaḻ taki variyār kaṟpiṉuḷḷē. 

 
## 	{SA TP225i} 	{N poruL-33} 	 
1.	iṟiccitāṉē uri+ puṟattatuvē. 

 
## 	{SA TP226i} 	{N poruL-34} 	 
1.	iṟicciyiṉ piṟakkum poruḷumār uḷavē 
2.	tiṟattu iyal maruṅkiṉ teriyumōrkkē. 

 
## 	{SA TP227i} 	{N poruL-35} 	 
1.	aṉpuṟu takuvaṉa iṟicciyuḷ cuṭṭalum 
2.	vaṉpuṟi ākum varuntiya poḻutē. 

 
## 	{SA TP228i} 	{N poruL-36} 	 
1.	cey poruḷ accamum viṉivayiṉ pirivum 
2.	meypeṟa uṇarttum kiḻavi pārāṭṭē. 

 
## 	{SA TP229i} 	{N poruL-37} 	 
1.	kaṟpuvaḻi+ paṭṭavaḷ parattimi ēttiṉum 
2.	uḷḷattu ūṭal uṇṭu eṉa moḻipa. 

 
## 	{SA TP230i} 	{N poruL-38} 	 
1.	kiḻavōḷ piṟaḷ kuṇam ivi eṉa+ kūṟi 
2.	kiḻavōṉ kuṟippiṉi uṇartaṟkum uriyaḷ. 

 
## 	{SA TP231i} 	{N poruL-39} 	 
1.	tam uṟu viḻumam parattiyar kūṟiṉum 
2.	meymmiyāka avarvayiṉ uṇarntum 
3.	talittāṭ kaḻaṟal tam etirppoḻutu iṉṟē 
4.	malitalum ūṭalum avi alaṅkaṭiyē. 

 
## 	{SA TP232i} 	{N poruL-40} 	 
1.	poḻutu talivitta kiyaṟu kāli 
2.	iṟanta pōla+ kiḷakkum kiḷavi 
3.	maṭaṉē varuttam maruṭki mikutiyoṭu 
4.	avi nāṟ poruṭkaṇ nikaḻum eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TP233i} 	{N poruL-41} 	 
1.	irantu kuṟiyuṟṟa kiḻavaṉi+ tōḻi 
2.	nirampa nīkki niṟuttal aṉṟiyum 
3.	vāymi kūṟalum poy talippeytalum 
4.	nal vakiyuṭiya nayattiṉ kūṟiyum 
5.	pal vakiyāṉum paṭikkavum peṟumē. 

 
## 	{SA TP234i} 	{N poruL-42} 	 
1.	uyar moḻi+ kiḷavi uṟaḻum kiḷavi 
2.	aiya+ kiḷavi āṭūuviṟku urittē. 

 
## 	{SA TP235i} 	{N poruL-43} 	 
1.	uṟukaṇ ōmpal taṉ iyalpu ākaliṉ 
2.	uriyatākum tōḻikaṇ uraṉē. 

 
## 	{SA TP236i} 	{N poruL-44} 	 
1.	uyar moḻi+ kiḷaviyum uriyavāl avaṭkē. 

 
## 	{SA TP237i} 	{N poruL-45} 	 
1.	vāyiṟ kiḷavi veḷippaṭa+ kiḷattal 
2.	tā iṉṟu uriya tamtam kūṟṟē. 

 
## 	{SA TP238i} 	{N poruL-46} 	 
1.	uṭaṉuṟi uvamam cuṭṭu naki ciṟappu eṉa+ 
2.	keṭal aru marapiṉ uḷḷuṟi aintē. 

 
## 	{SA TP239i} 	{N poruL-47} 	 
1.	antam il ciṟappiṉ ākiya iṉpam 
2.	taṉvayiṉ varutalum vakutta paṇpē. 

 
## 	{SA TP240i} 	{N poruL-48} 	 
1.	maṅkala moḻiyum viiya moḻiyum 
2.	māṟu il āṇmiyiṉ colliya moḻiyum 
3.	kūṟiya maruṅkin koḷḷum eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TP241i} 	{N poruL-49} 	 
1.	ciṉaṉē pētimi nimpiri nalkuravu 
2.	aṉi nāl vakiyum ciṟappoṭu varumē. 

 
## 	{SA TP242i} 	{N poruL-50} 	 
1.	aṉṉi eṉṉi eṉṟalum uḷavē 
2.	tol neṟi muṟimi colliṉum eḻuttiṉum 
3.	tōṉṟā marapiṉa eṉmaṉār pulavar. 

 
## 	{SA TP243i} 	{N poruL-51} 	 
1.	oppum uruvum veṟuppum eṉṟā 
2.	kaṟpum ērum eḻilum eṉṟā 
3.	cāyalum nāṇum maṭaṉum eṉṟā 
4.	nōyum vēṭkiyum nukarvum eṉṟu āṅku 
5.	āvayiṉ varūum kiḷavi ellām 
6.	nāṭṭu iyal marapiṉ neñcu koḷiṉ allatu 
7.	kāṭṭalākā+ poruḷa eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TP244i} 	{N poruL-52} 	 
1.	imiyōr tēettum eṟi kaṭal varippiṉum 
2.	avi il kālam iṉmiyāṉa. 


((6. meyppāṭṭu iyal))
 
## 	{SA TP245i} 	{N meypp-01} 	 
1.	paṇṇi+ tōṉṟiya eṇ nāṉku poruḷum 
2.	kaṇṇiya puṟaṉē nāl nāṉku eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TP246i} 	{N meypp-02} 	 
1.	nāl iraṇṭu ākum pālumār uṇṭē. 

 
## 	{SA TP247i} 	{N meypp-03} 	 
1.	nakiyē aḻuki iḷivaral maruṭki 
2.	accam perumitam vekuḷi uvaki eṉṟu 
3.	a+ pāl eṭṭē meyppāṭu eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TP248i} 	{N meypp-04} 	 
1.	eḷḷal iḷami pētimi maṭaṉ eṉṟu 
2.	uḷḷappaṭṭa naki nāṉku eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TP249i} 	{N meypp-05} 	 
1.	iḷivē iḻavē acivē vaṟumi eṉa 
2.	viḷivu il koḷki aḻuki nāṉkē. 

 
## 	{SA TP250i} 	{N meypp-06} 	 
1.	mūppē piṇiyē varuttam meṉmiyoṭu 
2.	yāppuṟa vanta iḷivaral nāṉkē. 

 
## 	{SA TP251i} 	{N meypp-07} 	 
1.	putumi perumi ciṟumi ākkamoṭu 
2.	matimi cālā maruṭki nāṉkē. 

 
## 	{SA TP252i} 	{N meypp-08} 	 
1.	aṇaṅkē vilaṅkē kaḷvar tam iṟi eṉa+ 
2.	piṇaṅkal cālā accam nāṉkē. 

 
## 	{SA TP253i} 	{N meypp-09} 	 
1.	kalvi taṟukaṇ pukaḻmi koṭi eṉa+ 
2.	collappaṭṭa perumitam nāṉkē. 

 
## 	{SA TP254i} 	{N meypp-10} 	 
1.	uṟuppaṟi kuṭikōḷ ali koli eṉṟa 
2.	veṟuppiṉ vanta vekuḷi nāṉkē. 

 
## 	{SA TP255i} 	{N meypp-11} 	 
1.	celvam pulaṉē puṇarvu viḷiyāṭṭu eṉṟu 
2.	allal nītta uvaki nāṉkē. 

 
## 	{SA TP256i} 	{N meypp-12} 	 
1.	āṅkavi oru pāl āka oru pāl 
2.	uṭimi iṉpuṟal naṭuvunili aruḷal 
3.	taṉmi aṭakkam varital aṉpu eṉāa 
4.	kimmikal nalital cūḻcci vāḻttal 
5.	nāṇutal tuñcal araṟṟu kaṉavu eṉāa 
6.	muṉital niṉital verūutal maṭimi 
7.	karutal ārāycci virivu uyirppu eṉāa 
8.	kiyāṟu iṭukkaṇ poccāppu poṟāmi 
9.	viyarttal aiyam miki naṭukku eṉāa 
10.	iviyum uḷavē avi alaṅkaṭiyē. 

 
## 	{SA TP257i} 	{N meypp-13} 	 
1.	puku mukam purital poṟi nutal viyarttal 
2.	naku nayam maṟittal citivu piṟarkku iṉmiyoṭu 
3.	taku muṟi nāṉkē oṉṟu eṉa moḻipa. 

 
## 	{SA TP258i} 	{N meypp-14} 	 
1.	kūḻi virittal kātu oṉṟu kaḷital 
2.	ūḻ aṇi tivaral uṭi peyarttu uṭuttaloṭu 
3.	ūḻi nāṉkē iraṇṭu eṉa moḻipa. 

 
## 	{SA TP259i} 	{N meypp-15} 	 
1.	alkul tivaral aṇintavi tiruttal 
2.	il valiyuṟuttal iru kiyum eṭuttaloṭu 
3.	colliya nāṉkē mūṉru eṉa moḻipa. 

 
## 	{SA TP260i} 	{N meypp-16} 	 
1.	pārāṭṭu eṭuttal maṭam tapa urittal 
2.	īram il kūṟṟam ēṟṟu alar nāṇal 
3.	koṭuppavi kōṭal uḷappaṭa+ tokii 
4.	eṭutta nāṉkē nāṉku eṉa moḻipa. 

 
## 	{SA TP261i} 	{N meypp-17} 	 
1.	terintu uṭampaṭutal tiḷippu viṉi maṟuttal 
2.	karantiṭattu oḻital kaṇṭavaḻi uvattaloṭu 
3.	poruntiya nāṉkē aintu eṉa moḻipa. 

 
## 	{SA TP262i} 	{N meypp-18} 	 
1.	puṟam ceya+ citital pulampi+ tōṉṟal 
2.	kalaṅki moḻital kiyaṟavu urittaloṭu 
3.	viḷampiya nāṉkē āṟu eṉa moḻipa. 

 
## 	{SA TP263i} 	{N meypp-19} 	 
1.	aṉṉa piṟavum avaṟṟoṭu civaṇi 
2.	maṉṉiya viṉiya nimittam eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TP264i} 	{N meypp-20} 	 
1.	viṉi uyir melivu iṭattu iṉmiyum urittē. 

 
## 	{SA TP265i} 	{N meypp-21} 	 
1.	aviyum uḷavē avi alaṅkaṭiyē. 

 
## 	{SA TP266i} 	{N meypp-22} 	 
1.	iṉpatti veṟuttal tuṉpattu+ pulampal 
2.	etir peytu parital ētam āytal 
3.	paci aṭa niṟṟal pacali pāytal 
4.	uṇṭiyiṉ kuṟital uṭampu naṉi curuṅkal 
5.	kaṇ tuyil maṟuttal kaṉavoṭu mayaṅkal 
6.	poyyā+ kōṭal meyyē eṉṟal 
7.	aiyam ceytal avaṉ tamar uvattal 
8.	aṟaṉ aḷittu urittal āṅku neñcu aḻital 
9.	em mey āyiṉum oppumi kōṭal 
10.	oppuvaḻi uvattal uṟu peyar kēṭṭal 
11.	nala+ taka nāṭiṉ kalakkamum atuvē. 

 
## 	{SA TP267i} 	{N meypp-23} 	 
1.	muṭṭuvayiṉ kaḻaṟal muṉivu meyn niṟuttal 
2.	accattiṉ akaṟal avaṉ puṇarvu maṟuttal 
3.	tūtu muṉivu iṉmi tuñci+ cērtal 
4.	kātal kimmikal kaṭṭuri iṉmi eṉṟu 
5.	āyiru-nāṉkē aḻivu il kūṭṭam. 

 
## 	{SA TP268i} 	{N meypp-24} 	 
1.	teyvam añcal puri aṟam teḷital 
2.	illatu kāytal uḷḷatu uvarttal 
3.	puṇarntuḻi uṇmi poḻutu maṟuppu ākkam 
4.	aruḷ mika uṭimi aṉpu toka niṟṟal 
5.	pirivu āṟṟāmi maṟintavi urittal 
6.	puṟañcol māṇā+ kiḷaviyoṭu tokii 
7.	ciṟanta pattum ceppiya poruḷē. 

 
## 	{SA TP269i} 	{N meypp-25} 	 
1.	piṟappē kuṭimi āṇmi āṇṭoṭu 
2.	uruvu niṟutta kāma vāyil 
3.	niṟiyē aruḷē uṇarvoṭu tiru eṉa 
4.	muṟiyuṟa+ kiḷanta oppiṉatu vakiyē. 

 
## 	{SA TP270i} 	{N meypp-26} 	 
1.	nimpiri koṭumi viyappoṭu puṟamoḻi 
2.	vaṉcol poccāppu maṭimiyoṭu kuṭimi 
3.	iṉpuṟal ēḻimi maṟappoṭu oppumi 
4.	eṉṟu ivi iṉmi eṉmaṉār pulavar. 

 
## 	{SA TP271i} 	{N meypp-27} 	 
1.	kaṇṇiṉum ceviyiṉum tiṇṇitiṉ uṇarum 
2.	uṇarvuṭi māntarkku allatu teriyiṉ 
3.	nal naya+ poruḷkōḷ eṇṇa aruṅkurittē. 


((7. uvama iyal))
 
## 	{SA TP272i} 	{N uvama-01} 	 
1.	viṉi payaṉ mey uru eṉṟa nāṉkē 
2.	vaki peṟa vanta uvama+ tōṟṟam. 

 
## 	{SA TP273i} 	{N uvama-02} 	 
1.	viraviyum varūum marapiṉa eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TP274i} 	{N uvama-03} 	 
1.	uyarntataṉ mēṟṟē uḷḷum kāli. 

 
## 	{SA TP275i} 	{N uvama-04} 	 
1.	ciṟappē nalaṉē kātal valiyoṭu 
2.	an nāl paṇpum nilikkaḷam eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TP276i} 	{N uvama-05} 	 
1.	kiḻakkiṭu poruḷoṭu aintum ākum. 

 
## 	{SA TP277i} 	{N uvama-06} 	 
1.	mutalum ciṉiyum eṉṟu āyiru poruṭkum 
2.	nutaliya marapiṉ uriyavi uriya. 

 
## 	{SA TP278i} 	{N uvama-07} 	 
1.	cuṭṭi+ kūṟā uvamam āyiṉ 
2.	poruḷ etir puṇarttu+ puṇarttaṉa koḷalē. 

 
## 	{SA TP279i} 	{N uvama-08} 	 
1.	uvamamum poruḷum ottal vēṇṭum. 

 
## 	{SA TP280i} 	{N uvama-09} 	 
1.	poruḷē uvamam ceytaṉar moḻiyiṉum 
2.	maruḷ aṟu ciṟappiṉ aḵtu uvamam ākum. 

 
## 	{SA TP281i} 	{N uvama-10} 	 
1.	perumiyum ciṟumiyum ciṟappiṉ tīrā+ 
2.	kuṟippiṉ varūum neṟippāṭu uṭiya. 

 
## 	{SA TP282i} 	{N uvama-11} 	 
1.	avitām, 
2.	aṉṉa ēyppa uṟaḻa oppa 
3.	eṉṉa māṉa eṉṟavi eṉāa 
4.	oṉṟa oṭuṅka oṭṭa āṅka 
5.	eṉṟa viyappa eṉṟavi eṉāa 
6.	eḷḷa viḻiya viṟappa nikarppa 
7.	kaḷḷa kaṭuppa āṅkavi eṉāa 
8.	kāyppa matippa takiya maruḷa 
9.	māṟṟa maṟuppa āṅkavi eṉāa 
10.	pulla poruva poṟpa pōla 
11.	vella vīḻa āṅkavi eṉāa 
12.	nāṭa naḷiya naṭuṅka nanta 
13.	ōṭa puriya eṉṟavi eṉāa 
14.	āṟu-āṟu aviyum aṉṉa piṟavum 
15.	kūṟum kāli+ pal kuṟippiṉavē. 

 
## 	{SA TP283i} 	{N uvama-12} 	 
1.	aṉṉa āṅka māṉa viṟappa 
2.	eṉṉa uṟaḻa takiya nōkkoṭu 
3.	kaṇṇiya eṭṭum viṉippāl uvamam. 

 
## 	{SA TP284i} 	{N uvama-13} 	 
1.	aṉṉa eṉ kiḷavi piṟavoṭum civaṇum. 

 
## 	{SA TP285i} 	{N uvama-14} 	 
1.	eḷḷa viḻiya pulla poruva 
2.	kaḷḷa matippa vella vīḻa 
3.	eṉṟu āṅku eṭṭē payaṉili uvamam. 

 
## 	{SA TP286i} 	{N uvama-15} 	 
1.	kaṭuppa ēyppa maruḷa puriya 
2.	oṭṭa oṭuṅka ōṭa nikarppa eṉṟu 
3.	a+ pāl eṭṭē meyppāl uuvamam. 

 
## 	{SA TP287i} 	{N uvama-16} 	 
1.	pōla maṟuppa oppa kāytta 
2.	nēra viyappa naḷiya nanta eṉṟu 
3.	ottu varu kiḷavi uruvin uvamam. 

 
## 	{SA TP288i} 	{N uvama-17} 	 
1.	tamtam marapiṉ tōṉṟumaṉ poruḷē. 

 
## 	{SA TP289i} 	{N uvama-18} 	 
1.	nāl iraṇṭu ākum pālumār uṇṭē. 

 
## 	{SA TP290i} 	{N uvama-19} 	 
1.	perumiyum ciṟumiyum meyppāṭu eṭṭaṉ 
2.	vaḻi maruṅku aṟiya+ tōṉṟum eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TP291i} 	{N uvama-20} 	 
1.	uvama+ poruḷiṉ uṟṟatu uṇarum 
2.	teḷi maruṅku uḷavē tiṟattu iyalāṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TP292i} 	{N uvama-21} 	 
1.	uvama+ poruḷi uṇarum kāli 
2.	marīiya marapiṉ vaḻakkoṭu varum ē. 

 
## 	{SA TP293i} 	{N uvama-22} 	 
1.	iraṭṭikkiḷavi iraṭṭi vaḻittē. 

 
## 	{SA TP294i} 	{N uvama-23} 	 
1.	piṟitoṭu paṭātu piṟappoṭu nōkki 
2.	muṉṉi marapiṉ kūṟum kāli 
3.	tuṇivoṭu varūum tuṇiviṉōr koḷiṉē. 

 
## 	{SA TP295i} 	{N uvama-24} 	 
1.	uvama+ pōli aintu eṉa moḻipa. 

 
## 	{SA TP296i} 	{N uvama-25} 	 
1.	taval aruñ ciṟappiṉ a+ taṉmi nāṭiṉ 
2.	viṉiyiṉum payattiṉum uṟuppiṉum uruviṉum 
3.	piṟappiṉum varūum tiṟatta eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TP297i} 	{N uvama-26} 	 
1.	kiḻavi colliṉ avaḷ aṟi kiḷavi. 

 
## 	{SA TP298i} 	{N uvama-27} 	 
1.	tōḻikku āyiṉ nilam peyarntu uriyātu. 

 
## 	{SA TP299i} 	{N uvama-28} 	 
1.	kiḻavōṟku āyiṉ uraṉoṭu kiḷakkum. 

 
## 	{SA TP300i} 	{N uvama-29} 	 
1.	ēṉōrkku ellām iṭam varivu iṉṟē. 

 
## 	{SA TP301i} 	{N uvama-30} 	 
1.	iṉitu uṟu kiḷaviyum tuṉi uṟu kiḷaviyum 
2.	uvama maruṅkiṉ tōṉṟum eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TP302i} 	{N uvama-31} 	 
1.	kiḻavōṭku uvamam īr iṭattu urittē. 

 
## 	{SA TP303i} 	{N uvama-32} 	 
1.	kiḻavōṟku āyiṉ iṭam varivu iṉṟē. 

 
## 	{SA TP304i} 	{N uvama-33} 	 
1.	tōḻiyum ceviliyum poruntuvaḻi nōkki+ 
2.	kūṟutaṟku uriyar koḷ vaḻiyāṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TP305i} 	{N uvama-34} 	 
1.	vēṟupaṭa vanta uvama+ tōṟṟam 
2.	kūṟiya maruṅkiṉ koḷ vaḻi+ koḷāal. 

 
## 	{SA TP306i} 	{N uvama-35} 	 
1.	orīi+ kūṟalum marīiya paṇpē. 

 
## 	{SA TP307i} 	{N uvama-36} 	 
1.	uvama+ taṉmi ~um urittu eṉa moḻipa 
2.	payaṉili purinta vaḻakkattāṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TP308i} 	{N uvama-37} 	 
1.	taṭumāṟu uvamam kaṭi vari iṉṟē. 

 
## 	{SA TP309i} 	{N uvama-38} 	 
1.	aṭukkiya tōṟṟam viṭuttal paṇpē 
2.	niral niṟuttu amittal niral-niṟi cuṇṇam 
3.	varaṉ muṟi vanta mūṉṟu alaṅkaṭiyē. 


((8. ceyyuḷ iyal))
 
## 	{SA TP310i} 	{N ceyyu-01} 	 
1.	māttiri eḻuttu iyal aci vaki eṉāa 
2.	yātta cīrē aṭi yāppu eṉāa 
3.	marapē tūkkē toṭi vaki eṉāa 
4.	nōkkē pāvē aḷavu iyal eṉāa 
5.	tiṇiyē kikōḷ kūṟṟu vaki eṉāa 
6.	keṭpōr kaḷaṉē kāla vaki eṉāa 
7.	payaṉē meyppāṭu ecca vaki eṉāa 
8.	muṉṉam poruḷē tuṟi vaki eṉāa 
9.	māṭṭē vaṇṇamoṭu yāppu iyal vakiyiṉ 
10.	āṟu tali iṭṭa an nāl-aintum 
11.	ammi aḻaku toṉmi tōlē 
12.	viruntē iyipē pulaṉē iḻipu eṉāa+ 
13.	porunta+ kūṟiya eṭṭoṭum tokii 
14.	nal ici+ pulavar ceyyuḷ uṟuppu eṉa 
15.	vallitiṉ kūṟi vakuttu urittaṉarē. 

 
## 	{SA TP311i} 	{N ceyyu-02} 	 
1.	avaṟṟuḷ, 
2.	māttiri vakiyum eḻuttu iyal vakiyum 
3.	mēl kiḷantaṉavē eṉmaṉār pulavar. 

 
## 	{SA TP312i} 	{N ceyyu-03} 	 
1.	kuṟilē neṭilē kuṟil-iṇi kuṟil-neṭil 
2.	oṟṟoṭu varutaloṭu mey+ paṭa nāṭi 
3.	nērum niriyum eṉṟiciṉ peyarē. 

 
## 	{SA TP313i} 	{N ceyyu-04} 	 
1.	iru vaki ukaramoṭu iyintavi variṉē 
2.	nērpum niripum ākum eṉpa 
3.	kuṟil-iṇi ukaram al vaḻiyāṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TP314i} 	{N ceyyu-05} 	 
1.	iyalaci mutal iraṇṭu ēṉavi uriyaci. 

 
## 	{SA TP315i} 	{N ceyyu-06} 	 
1.	taṉi+ kuṟil mutalaci moḻi citintu ākātu. 

 
## 	{SA TP316i} 	{N ceyyu-07} 	 
1.	oṟṟu eḻuttu iyaṟṟē kuṟṟiyalikaram. 

 
## 	{SA TP317i} 	{N ceyyu-08} 	 
1.	muṟṟiyalukaramum moḻi citittu+ koḷāa 
2.	niṟṟal iṉṟē īṟṟu aṭi maruṅkiṉum. 

 
## 	{SA TP318i} 	{N ceyyu-09} 	 
1.	kuṟṟiyalukaramum muṟṟiyalukaramum 
2.	oṟṟoṭu tōṉṟi niṟkavum peṟumē. 

 
## 	{SA TP319i} 	{N ceyyu-10} 	 
1.	aciyum cīrum iciyoṭu cērtti 
2.	vakuttaṉar uṇarttal vallōr āṟē. 

 
## 	{SA TP320i} 	{N ceyyu-11} 	 
1.	īr aci koṇṭum mū aci puṇarttum 
2.	cīr iyintu iṟṟatu cīr eṉappaṭumē. 

 
## 	{SA TP321i} 	{N ceyyu-12} 	 
1.	iyalaci mayakkam iyaṟcīr ēṉi 
2.	uriyaci mayakkam āciriya uriccīr. 

 
## 	{SA TP322i} 	{N ceyyu-13} 	 
1.	muṉ niri uṟiṉum aṉṉa ākum. 

 
## 	{SA TP323i} 	{N ceyyu-14} 	 
1.	nēr avaṇ niṟpiṉ iyaṟcīr+ pāla. 

 
## 	{SA TP324i} 	{N ceyyu-15} 	 
1.	iyalaci īṟṟu muṉ uriyaci variṉē 
2.	niriyaci iyala ākum eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TP325i} 	{N ceyyu-16} 	 
1.	aḷapeṭi acinili ākalum urittē. 

 
## 	{SA TP326i} 	{N ceyyu-17} 	 
1.	oṟṟu aḷapeṭuppiṉum aṟṟu eṉa moḻipa. 

 
## 	{SA TP327i} 	{N ceyyu-18} 	 
1.	iyaṟcīr iṟuti muṉ nēr avaṇ niṟpiṉ 
2.	uriccīr veṇpā ākum eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TP328i} 	{N ceyyu-19} 	 
1.	vañci+ cīr eṉa vaki peṟṟaṉavē 
2.	veṇ cīr allā mū aci eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TP329i} 	{N ceyyu-20} 	 
1.	taṉ pā al vaḻi tāṉ aṭivu iṉṟē. 

 
## 	{SA TP330i} 	{N ceyyu-21} 	 
1.	vañci maruṅkiṉ eñciya uriya. 

 
## 	{SA TP331i} 	{N ceyyu-22} 	 
1.	veṇpā uriccīr āciriya uriccīr 
2.	iṉ pā nēraṭikku oruṅku nili ilavē. 

 
## 	{SA TP332i} 	{N ceyyu-23} 	 
1.	kalittaḷi maruṅkiṉ kaṭiyavum peṟāa. 

 
## 	{SA TP333i} 	{N ceyyu-24} 	 
1.	kalittaḷi aṭivayiṉ nēr īṟṟu iyaṟcīr 
2.	nilikku urittaṉṟē teriyumōrkkē. 

 
## 	{SA TP334i} 	{N ceyyu-25} 	 
1.	vañci maruṅkiṉum iṟuti nillā. 

 
## 	{SA TP335i} 	{N ceyyu-26} 	 
1.	icinili niṟiya niṟkuvatu āyiṉ 
2.	acinili variyār cīr nili peṟavē. 

 
## 	{SA TP336i} 	{N ceyyu-27} 	 
1.	iyaṟcīr+ pāṟpaṭuttu iyaṟṟiṉar koḷalē 
2.	taḷi vaki citiyā+ taṉmiyāṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TP337i} 	{N ceyyu-28} 	 
1.	veṇcīr īṟṟaci niriyaci iyaṟṟē. 

 
## 	{SA TP338i} 	{N ceyyu-29} 	 
1.	iṉ cīr iyiya varukuvatu āyiṉ 
2.	veṇcīr variyār āciriya aṭikkē. 

 
## 	{SA TP339i} 	{N ceyyu-30} 	 
1.	an nili maruṅkiṉ vañci uriccīr 
2.	oṉṟutal uṭiya ōr oru vaḻiyē. 

 
## 	{SA TP340i} 	{N ceyyu-31} 	 
1.	nāṟ cīr koṇṭatu aṭi eṉappaṭumē. 

 
## 	{SA TP341i} 	{N ceyyu-32} 	 
1.	aṭi uḷḷaṉavē taḷiyoṭu toṭiyē. 

 
## 	{SA TP342i} 	{N ceyyu-33} 	 
1.	aṭi iṟantu varutal il eṉa moḻipa. 

 
## 	{SA TP343i} 	{N ceyyu-34} 	 
1.	aṭiyiṉ ciṟappē pāṭṭu eṉappaṭumē. 

 
## 	{SA TP344i} 	{N ceyyu-35} 	 
1.	nāl eḻuttu āti āka āṟu eḻuttu 
2.	ēṟiya nilattē kuṟaḷaṭi eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TP345i} 	{N ceyyu-36} 	 
1.	ēḻ eḻuttu eṉpa cintaṭikku aḷavē 
2.	īr eḻuttu ēṟṟam av vaḻiyāṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TP346i} 	{N ceyyu-37} 	 
1.	pattu eḻuttu eṉpa nēraṭikku aḷavē 
2.	otta nāl eḻuttu ēṟṟalaṅkaṭiyē. 

 
## 	{SA TP347i} 	{N ceyyu-38} 	 
1.	mū-aintu eḻuttē neṭilaṭikku aḷavē 
2.	īr eḻuttu mikutalum iyalpu eṉa moḻipa. 

 
## 	{SA TP348i} 	{N ceyyu-39} 	 
1.	mū-āṟu eḻuttē kaḻineṭiṟku aḷavē 
2.	īr eḻuttu mikutalum iyalpu eṉa moḻipa. 

 
## 	{SA TP349i} 	{N ceyyu-40} 	 
1.	cīr nilitāṉē aintu eḻuttu iṟavātu 
2.	nēr nili vañcikku āṟum ākum. 

 
## 	{SA TP350i} 	{N ceyyu-41} 	 
1.	eḻuttu aḷavu eñciṉum cīr nilitāṉē 
2.	kuṉṟalum mikutalum il eṉa moḻipa. 

 
## 	{SA TP351i} 	{N ceyyu-42} 	 
1.	uyir il eḻuttum eṇṇappaṭāa 
2.	uyir+ tiṟam iyakkam iṉmiyāṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TP352i} 	{N ceyyu-43} 	 
1.	vañci aṭiyē iru cīrttu ākum. 

 
## 	{SA TP353i} 	{N ceyyu-44} 	 
1.	taṉ cīr eḻuttiṉ ciṉmi mūṉṟē. 

 
## 	{SA TP354i} 	{N ceyyu-45} 	 
1.	mu+ cīrāṉum varum iṭaṉ uṭittē. 

 
## 	{SA TP355i} 	{N ceyyu-46} 	 
1.	aci kūṉ ākum avvayiṉāṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TP356i} 	{N ceyyu-47} 	 
1.	cīr kūṉ ātal nēraṭikku urittē. 

 
## 	{SA TP357i} 	{N ceyyu-48} 	 
1.	aivaki aṭiyum virikkum kāli 
2.	mey vaki aminta patiṉēḻ nilattum 
3.	eḻupatu vakiyiṉ vaḻu ila āki 
4.	aṟunūṟṟu irupattintu ākummē. 

 
## 	{SA TP358i} 	{N ceyyu-49} 	 
1.	āṅkaṉam virippiṉ aḷavu iṟantaṉavē 
2.	pāṅkuṟa uṇarntōr paṉṉum kāli. 

 
## 	{SA TP359i} 	{N ceyyu-50} 	 
1.	aivaki aṭiyum āciriyakku uriya. 

 
## 	{SA TP360i} 	{N ceyyu-51} 	 
1.	virāay variṉum orūu nili ilavē. 

 
## 	{SA TP361i} 	{N ceyyu-52} 	 
1.	taṉ cīr vakiyiṉum taḷi nili vakiyiṉum 
2.	iṉ cīr vakiyiṉ aintu aṭikkum uriya 
3.	taṉ cīr uḷvaḻi+ taḷi vaki vēṇṭā. 

 
## 	{SA TP362i} 	{N ceyyu-53} 	 
1.	cīr iyi maruṅkiṉ ōr aci oppiṉ 
2.	āciriya+ taḷi eṉṟu aṟiyal vēṇṭum. 

 
## 	{SA TP363i} 	{N ceyyu-54} 	 
1.	kuṟaḷaṭi mutalā aḷavaṭi kāṟum 
2.	uṟaḻ nili ilavē vañcikku eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TP364i} 	{N ceyyu-55} 	 
1.	aḷavum cintum veḷḷikku uriya 
2.	taḷi vaki oṉṟā+ taṉmiyāṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TP365i} 	{N ceyyu-56} 	 
1.	aḷavaṭi mikuti uḷappaṭa+ tōṉṟi 
2.	iru neṭilaṭiyum kaliyiṟku uriya. 

 
## 	{SA TP366i} 	{N ceyyu-57} 	 
1.	niri mutal veṇcīr vantu niri taṭpiṉum 
2.	vari nili iṉṟē av aṭikku eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TP367i} 	{N ceyyu-58} 	 
1.	virāaya taḷiyum orūu nili iṉṟē. 

 
## 	{SA TP368i} 	{N ceyyu-59} 	 
1.	iyaṟcīr veḷḷaṭi āciriya maruṅkiṉ 
2.	nilikku uri marapiṉ niṟkavum peṟumē. 

 
## 	{SA TP369i} 	{N ceyyu-60} 	 
1.	veṇtaḷi viraviyum āciriyam viraviyum 
2.	aiñ cīr aṭiyum uḷa eṉa moḻipa. 

 
## 	{SA TP370i} 	{N ceyyu-61} 	 
1.	aṟu cīr aṭiyē āciriya+ taḷiyoṭu 
2.	neṟi peṟṟu varūum nēraṭi muṉṉē. 

 
## 	{SA TP371i} 	{N ceyyu-62} 	 
1.	eḻu cīr aṭiyē muṭukiyal naṭakkum. 

 
## 	{SA TP372i} 	{N ceyyu-63} 	 
1.	muṭukiyal variyār mutal īr aṭikkum. 

 
## 	{SA TP373i} 	{N ceyyu-64} 	 
1.	āciriya maruṅkiṉum veṇpā maruṅkiṉum 
2.	mū vaki aṭiyum muṉṉutal ilavē. 

 
## 	{SA TP374i} 	{N ceyyu-65} 	 
1.	īṟṟu ayal aṭiyē āciriya maruṅkiṉ 
2.	tōṟṟam mu+ cīrttu ākum eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TP375i} 	{N ceyyu-66} 	 
1.	iṭiyum variyār toṭi uṇarvōrē. 

 
## 	{SA TP376i} 	{N ceyyu-67} 	 
1.	mu+ cīr muraṟkiyuḷ niṟiyavum niṟkum. 

 
## 	{SA TP377i} 	{N ceyyu-68} 	 
1.	vañci+ tūkkē centūkku iyaṟṟē. 

 
## 	{SA TP378i} 	{N ceyyu-69} 	 
1.	veṇpāṭṭu īṟṟu aṭi mu+ cīrttu ākum 
2.	aci cīrttu ākum av vaḻiyāṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TP379i} 	{N ceyyu-70} 	 
1.	nēr īṟṟu iyaṟcīr niriyum niripum 
2.	cīr ēṟṟu iṟūum iyaṟkiya eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TP380i} 	{N ceyyu-71} 	 
1.	niri avaṇ niṟpiṉ nērum nērpum 
2.	varivu iṉṟu eṉpa vāy moḻi+ pulavar. 

 
## 	{SA TP381i} 	{N ceyyu-72} 	 
1.	eḻu cīr iṟuti āciriyam kaliyē. 

 
## 	{SA TP382i} 	{N ceyyu-73} 	 
1.	veṇpā iyaliṉum paṇpuṟa muṭiyum. 

 
## 	{SA TP383i} 	{N ceyyu-74} 	 
1.	eḻuttu mutalā īṇṭiya aṭiyiṉ 
2.	kuṟitta poruḷi muṭiya nāṭṭal 
3.	yāppu eṉa moḻipa yāppu aṟipulavar. 

 
## 	{SA TP384i} 	{N ceyyu-75} 	 
1.	pāṭṭu uri nūlē vāymoḻi piciyē 
2.	aṅkatam mutucol av ēḻ nilattum 
3.	vaṇ pukaḻ mūvar taṇ poḻil varippiṉ 
4.	nāṟ peyar elli akattavar vaḻaṅkum 
5.	yāppiṉ vaḻiyatu eṉmaṉār pulavar. 

 
## 	{SA TP385i} 	{N ceyyu-76} 	 
1.	marapētāṉum, 
2.	nāṟ col iyalāṉ yāppuvaḻi+ paṭṭaṉṟu. 

 
## 	{SA TP386i} 	{N ceyyu-77} 	 
1.	akaval eṉpatu āciriyammē. 

 
## 	{SA TP387i} 	{N ceyyu-78} 	 
1.	atāaṉṟu eṉpa veṇpā yāppē. 

 
## 	{SA TP388i} 	{N ceyyu-79} 	 
1.	tuḷḷal ōci kali eṉa moḻipa. 

 
## 	{SA TP389i} 	{N ceyyu-80} 	 
1.	tūṅkal ōci vañci ākum. 

 
## 	{SA TP390i} 	{N ceyyu-81} 	 
1.	maruṭpā ēṉi iru cār allatu 
2.	tāṉ itu eṉṉum taṉinili iṉṟē. 

 
## 	{SA TP391i} 	{N ceyyu-82} 	 
1.	av iyal allatu pāṭṭu āṅku+ kiḷavār. 

 
## 	{SA TP392i} 	{N ceyyu-83} 	 
1.	tūkku iyal vakiyē āṅku eṉa moḻipa. 

 
## 	{SA TP393i} 	{N ceyyu-84} 	 
1.	mōṉi etuki muraṇē iyipu eṉa 
2.	nāl neṟi marapiṉa toṭi vaki eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TP394i} 	{N ceyyu-85} 	 
1.	aḷapeṭi talippeya aintum ākum. 

 
## 	{SA TP395i} 	{N ceyyu-86} 	 
1.	poḻippum orūuvum centoṭi marapum 
2.	amittaṉar teriyiṉ aviyumār uḷavē. 

 
## 	{SA TP396i} 	{N ceyyu-87} 	 
1.	niral-niṟuttu amittalum iraṭṭi yāppum 
2.	moḻintavaṟṟu iyalāṉ muṟṟum eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TP397i} 	{N ceyyu-88} 	 
1.	aṭitoṟum tali eḻuttu oppatu mōṉi. 

 
## 	{SA TP398i} 	{N ceyyu-89} 	 
1.	aḵtu oḻittu oṉṟiṉ etuki ākum. 

 
## 	{SA TP399i} 	{N ceyyu-90} 	 
1.	āyiru toṭikkum kiḷiyeḻuttu uriya. 

 
## 	{SA TP400i} 	{N ceyyu-91} 	 
1.	moḻiyiṉum poruḷiṉum muraṇutal muraṇē. 

 
## 	{SA TP401i} 	{N ceyyu-92} 	 
1.	iṟuvāy oṉṟal iyipiṉ yāppē. 

 
## 	{SA TP402i} 	{N ceyyu-93} 	 
1.	aḷapu eḻiṉ aviyē aḷapeṭi+ toṭiyē. 

 
## 	{SA TP403i} 	{N ceyyu-94} 	 
1.	oru cīr iṭiyiṭṭu etuki āyiṉ 
2.	poḻippu eṉa moḻital pulavar āṟē. 

 
## 	{SA TP404i} 	{N ceyyu-95} 	 
1.	iru cīr iṭiyiṭiṉ orūu eṉa moḻipa. 

 
## 	{SA TP405i} 	{N ceyyu-96} 	 
1.	colliya toṭiyoṭu vēṟupaṭṭu iyaliṉ 
2.	col iyaṟ pulavar atu centoṭi eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TP406i} 	{N ceyyu-97} 	 
1.	mey peṟu marapiṉ toṭi vakitāmē 
2.	ai-īr āyirattu āṟu-aiññūṟṟoṭu 
3.	toṇṭu tali iṭṭa pattu+ kuṟi eḻunūṟṟu 
4.	oṉpaḵtu eṉpa uṇarnticiṉōrē. 

 
## 	{SA TP407i} 	{N ceyyu-98} 	 
1.	terintaṉar virippiṉ varampu ila ākum. 

 
## 	{SA TP408i} 	{N ceyyu-99} 	 
1.	toṭi vaki niliyē āṅku eṉa moḻipa. 

 
## 	{SA TP409i} 	{N ceyyu-100} 	 
1.	māttiri mutalā aṭinili kāṟum 
2.	nōkkutal kāraṇam nōkku eṉappaṭumē. 

 
## 	{SA TP410i} 	{N ceyyu-101} 	 
1.	āciriyam vañci veṇpā kali eṉa 
2.	nāl iyaṟṟu eṉpa pā vaki viriyē. 

 
## 	{SA TP411i} 	{N ceyyu-102} 	 
1.	an nili maruṅkiṉ aṟam mutal ākiya 
2.	mum mutal poruṭkum uriya eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TP412i} 	{N ceyyu-103} 	 
1.	pā viri maruṅkiṉi+ paṇpuṟa+ tokuppiṉ 
2.	āciriyappā veṇpā eṉṟu āṅku 
3.	āyiru pāvinuḷ aṭaṅkum eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TP413i} 	{N ceyyu-104} 	 
1.	āciriya naṭittē vañci ēṉi 
2.	veṇpā naṭittē kali eṉa moḻipa. 

 
## 	{SA TP414i} 	{N ceyyu-105} 	 
1.	vāḻttiyal vakiyē nāṟpākkum urittē. 

 
## 	{SA TP415i} 	{N ceyyu-106} 	 
1.	vaḻipaṭu teyvam niṉ puṟaṅkāppa 
2.	paḻi tīr celvamoṭu vaḻi vaḻi ciṟantu 
3.	polimiṉ eṉṉum puṟanili vāḻttē 
4.	kali nili vakiyum vañciyum peṟāa. 

 
## 	{SA TP416i} 	{N ceyyu-107} 	 
1.	vāyuṟi vāḻttē aviyaṭakkiyalē 
2.	ceviyaṟivuṟūu eṉa aviyum aṉṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TP417i} 	{N ceyyu-108} 	 
1.	vāyuṟi vāḻttē vayaṅka nāṭiṉ 
2.	vēmpum kaṭuvum pōla veñ col 
3.	tāṅkutal iṉṟi vaḻi naṉi payakkum eṉṟu 
4.	ōmpaṭi+ kiḷaviyiṉ vāyuṟuttaṟṟē. 

 
## 	{SA TP418i} 	{N ceyyu-109} 	 
1.	aviyaṭakkiyalē aril tapa+ teriyiṉ 
2.	vallā kūṟiṉum vakuttaṉar koṇmiṉ eṉṟu 
3.	ellā māntarkkum vaḻi moḻintaṉṟē. 

 
## 	{SA TP419i} 	{N ceyyu-110} 	 
1.	ceviyuṟitāṉē, 
2.	poṅkutal iṉṟi puriyōr nāppaṇ 
3.	avital kaṭaṉ eṉa+ ceviyuṟuttan 

 
## 	{SA TP420i} 	{N ceyyu-111} 	 
1.	ottāḻiciyum maṇṭila yāppum 
2.	kuṭṭamum nēraṭikku oṭṭiṉa eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TP421i} 	{N ceyyu-112} 	 
1.	kuṭṭam eruttaṭi uṭittum ākum. 

 
## 	{SA TP422i} 	{N ceyyu-113} 	 
1.	maṇṭilam kuṭṭam eṉṟu ivi iraṇṭum 
2.	centūkku iyala eṉmaṉār pulavar. 

 
## 	{SA TP423i} 	{N ceyyu-114} 	 
1.	neṭuveṇpāṭṭē kuṟuveṇpāṭṭē 
2.	kikkiḷi paripāṭṭu aṅkata+ ceyyuḷoṭu 
3.	ottavi ellām veṇpā yāppiṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TP424i} 	{N ceyyu-115} 	 
1.	kikkiḷitāṉē veṇpā āki 
2.	āciriya iyalāṉ muṭiyavum peṟumē. 

 
## 	{SA TP425i} 	{N ceyyu-116} 	 
1.	paripāṭallē toki nili vakiyiṉ 
2.	itu pā eṉṉum iyal neṟi iṉṟi 
3.	potuvāy niṟṟaṟkum urittu eṉa moḻipa. 

 
## 	{SA TP426i} 	{N ceyyu-117} 	 
1.	koccakam arākam curitakam eruttoṭu 
2.	ceppiya nāṉkum taṉakku uṟuppu āka 
3.	kāmam kaṇṇiya nilimittu ākum. 

 
## 	{SA TP427i} 	{N ceyyu-118} 	 
1.	coṟcīr aṭiyum muṭukiyal aṭiyum 
2.	a+ pā nilimikku uriya ākum. 

 
## 	{SA TP428i} 	{N ceyyu-119} 	 
1.	kaṭṭuri vakiyāṉ eṇṇoṭu puṇarntum 
2.	muṭṭaṭi iṉṟi+ kuṟivu cīrttu ākiyum 
3.	moḻi aci ākiyum vaḻi-aci puṇarntum 
4.	coṟcīrttu iṟutal coṟcīrkku iyalpē. 

 
## 	{SA TP429i} 	{N ceyyu-120} 	 
1.	aṅkatamtāṉē aril tapa+ teriyiṉ 
2.	cemporuḷ karantatu eṉa iru vakittē. 

 
## 	{SA TP430i} 	{N ceyyu-121} 	 
1.	cemporuḷ āyiṉa vaci eṉappaṭumē. 

 
## 	{SA TP431i} 	{N ceyyu-122} 	 
1.	moḻi karantu moḻiyiṉ atu paḻikarappu ākum. 

 
## 	{SA TP432i} 	{N ceyyu-123} 	 
1.	ceyyuḷtāmē iraṇṭu eṉa moḻipa. 

 
## 	{SA TP433i} 	{N ceyyu-124} 	 
1.	tukaḷoṭum poruḷoṭum puṇarntaṉṟu āyiṉ 
2.	ceviyuṟi+ ceyyuḷ eṉmaṉār pulavar. 

 
## 	{SA TP434i} 	{N ceyyu-125} 	 
1.	vaciyoṭum naciyoṭum puṇarntaṉṟu āyiṉ 
2.	aṅkata+ ceyyuḷ eṉmaṉār pulavar. 

 
## 	{SA TP435i} 	{N ceyyu-126} 	 
1.	ottāḻicikkali kaliveṇpāṭṭē 
2.	koccakam uṟaḻoṭu kali nāl vakittē. 

 
## 	{SA TP436i} 	{N ceyyu-127} 	 
1.	avaṟṟuḷ, 
2.	ottāḻicikkali iru vakittu ākum. 

 
## 	{SA TP437i} 	{N ceyyu-128} 	 
1.	iṭinilippāṭṭē taravu pōkku aṭi eṉa 
2.	naṭi naviṉṟu oḻukum oṉṟu eṉa moḻipa. 

 
## 	{SA TP438i} 	{N ceyyu-129} 	 
1.	taravētāṉum nāl aṭi iḻipu āy 
2.	āṟu-iraṇṭu uyarvum piṟavum peṟumē. 

 
## 	{SA TP439i} 	{N ceyyu-130} 	 
1.	iṭinilippāṭṭē, 
2.	taravu akappaṭṭa marapiṉatu eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TP440i} 	{N ceyyu-131} 	 
1.	aṭi nili+ kiḷavi tāḻici+ piṉṉar 
2.	naṭi naviṉṟu oḻukum āṅku eṉ kiḷavi. 

 
## 	{SA TP441i} 	{N ceyyu-132} 	 
1.	pōkku iyal vakiyē vippu eṉappaṭumē 
2.	taravu iyal ottum ataṉ akappaṭumē 
3.	puri tīr iṟuti niliyurittaṉṟē. 

 
## 	{SA TP442i} 	{N ceyyu-133} 	 
1.	ēṉi oṉṟē, 
2.	tēvar+ parāaya muṉṉilikkaṇṇē. 

 
## 	{SA TP443i} 	{N ceyyu-134} 	 
1.	atuvē, 
2.	vaṇṇakam orupōku eṉa iru vakittē. 

 
## 	{SA TP444i} 	{N ceyyu-135} 	 
1.	vaṇṇakamtāṉē, 
2.	taravē tāḻici eṇṇē vāram eṉṟu 
3.	an nāl vakiyiṉ tōṉṟum eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TP445i} 	{N ceyyu-136} 	 
1.	taravētāṉum, 
2.	nāṉkum āṟum eṭṭum eṉṟa 
3.	nēraṭi paṟṟiya nilimittu ākum. 

 
## 	{SA TP446i} 	{N ceyyu-137} 	 
1.	ottu mūṉṟu ākum ottāḻiciyē 
2.	taraviṉ curuṅki+ tōṉṟum eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TP447i} 	{N ceyyu-138} 	 
1.	aṭakku iyal vāram taravoṭu okkum. 

 
## 	{SA TP448i} 	{N ceyyu-139} 	 
1.	mutal toṭi peruki+ curuṅkumaṉ eṇṇē. 

 
## 	{SA TP449i} 	{N ceyyu-140} 	 
1.	eṇ iṭi oḻital ētam iṉṟē 
2.	ciṉṉam allā+ kāliyāṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TP450i} 	{N ceyyu-141} 	 
1.	orupōku iyaṟkiyum iru vakittu ākum. 

 
## 	{SA TP451i} 	{N ceyyu-142} 	 
1.	koccaka orupōku ampōtaraṅkam eṉṟu 
2.	oppa nāṭi uṇartal vēṇṭum. 

 
## 	{SA TP452i} 	{N ceyyu-143} 	 
1.	taravu iṉṟu āki+ tāḻici peṟṟum 
2.	tāḻici iṉṟi+ taravu uṭittu ākiyum 
3.	eṇ iṭi iṭṭu+ ciṉṉam kuṉṟiyum 
4.	aṭakkiyal iṉṟi aṭi nimirntu oḻukiyum 
5.	yāppiṉum poruḷiṉum vēṟṟumi uṭiyatu 
6.	koccaka orupōku ākum eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TP453i} 	{N ceyyu-144} 	 
1.	orupāṉ ciṟumi iraṭṭi ataṉ uyarpē. 

 
## 	{SA TP454i} 	{N ceyyu-145} 	 
1.	ampōtaraṅkam aṟupatiṟṟu aṭittē 
2.	cempāl vāram ciṟumikku elli. 

 
## 	{SA TP455i} 	{N ceyyu-146} 	 
1.	eruttē koccakam arākam ciṟṟeṇ 
2.	aṭakkiyal vāramoṭu an nilikku urittē. 

 
## 	{SA TP456i} 	{N ceyyu-147} 	 
1.	oru poruḷ nutaliya veḷḷaṭi iyalāṉ 
2.	tiripu iṉṟi varuvatu kaliveṇpāṭṭē. 

 
## 	{SA TP457i} 	{N ceyyu-148} 	 
1.	taravum pōkkum pāṭṭu iṭi miṭintum 
2.	aiñ cīr aṭukkiyum āṟu mey peṟṟum 
3.	veṇpā iyalāṉ veḷippaṭa+ tōṉṟum 
4.	pānili vakiyē koccaka+ kali eṉa 
5.	nūl navil pulavar nuvaṉṟu aṟintaṉarē. 

 
## 	{SA TP458i} 	{N ceyyu-149} 	 
1.	kūṟṟum māṟṟamum iṭi iṭi miṭintum 
2.	pōkku iṉṟākal uṟaḻkalikku iyalpē. 

 
## 	{SA TP459i} 	{N ceyyu-150} 	 
1.	āciriya+ pāṭṭiṉ aḷaviṟku elli 
2.	āyiram ākum iḻipu mūṉṟu aṭiyē. 

 
## 	{SA TP460i} 	{N ceyyu-151} 	 
1.	neṭuveṇpāṭṭē mun-nāl aṭittē 
2.	kuṟuveṇpāṭṭiṉ aḷavu eḻu cīrē. 

 
## 	{SA TP461i} 	{N ceyyu-152} 	 
1.	aṅkata+ pāṭṭu aḷavu avaṟṟoṭu okkum. 

 
## 	{SA TP462i} 	{N ceyyu-153} 	 
1.	kaliveṇpāṭṭē kikkiḷi+ ceyyuḷ 
2.	ceviyaṟi vāyuṟi puṟanili eṉṟu ivi 
3.	toku nili marapiṉ aṭi ila eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TP463i} 	{N ceyyu-154} 	 
1.	puṟanili vāyuṟi ceviyaṟivuṟūu eṉa+ 
2.	tiṟanili mūṉṟum tiṇṇitiṉ teriyiṉ 
3.	veṇpā iyaliṉum āciriya iyaliṉum 
4.	paṇpuṟa muṭiyum pāliṉa eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TP464i} 	{N ceyyu-155} 	 
1.	paripāṭallē, 
2.	nāl-īr aimpatu uyarpu aṭi āka 
3.	ai-aintu ākum iḻipu aṭikku elli. 

 
## 	{SA TP465i} 	{N ceyyu-156} 	 
1.	aḷaviyal vakiyē aṉi vakippaṭumē. 

 
## 	{SA TP466i} 	{N ceyyu-157} 	 
1.	eḻu nilattu eḻunta ceyyuḷ teriyiṉ 
2.	aṭi vari illaṉa āṟu eṉa moḻipa. 

 
## 	{SA TP467i} 	{N ceyyu-158} 	 
1.	avitām, 
2.	nūliṉāṉa uriyiṉāṉa 
3.	noṭiyoṭu puṇarnta piciyiṉāṉa 
4.	ētu nutaliya mutumoḻiyāṉa 
5.	maṟi moḻi kiḷanta mantirattāṉa 
6.	kūṟṟu iṭi vitta kuṟippiṉāṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TP468i} 	{N ceyyu-159} 	 
1.	avaṟṟuḷ, 
2.	nūl eṉappaṭuvatu nuvalum kāli 
3.	mutalum muṭivum māṟukōḷ iṉṟi 
4.	tokiyiṉum vakiyiṉum poruṇmi kāṭṭi 
5.	uḷ niṉṟu akaṉṟa uriyoṭu puṇarntu 
6.	nuṇṇitiṉ viḷakkal atu ataṉ paṇpē. 

 
## 	{SA TP469i} 	{N ceyyu-160} 	 
1.	atuvētāṉum oru nāl vakittē. 

 
## 	{SA TP470i} 	{N ceyyu-161} 	 
1.	oru poruḷ nutaliya cūttirattāṉum 
2.	iṉa moḻi kiḷanta ōttiṉāṉum 
3.	potu moḻi kiḷanta paṭalattāṉum 
4.	mūṉṟu uṟuppu aṭakkiya piṇṭattāṉum eṉṟu 
5.	āṅku aṉi marapiṉ iyalum eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TP471i} 	{N ceyyu-162} 	 
1.	avaṟṟuḷ, 
2.	cūttiram tāṉē 
3.	āṭi niḻaliṉ aṟiya+ tōṉṟi 
4.	nāṭutal iṉṟi+ poruḷ naṉi viḷaṅka 
5.	yāppiṉuḷ tōṉṟa yāttu amippatuvē. 

 
## 	{SA TP472i} 	{N ceyyu-163} 	 
1.	nēr iṉa maṇiyi niralpaṭa vittāṅku 
2.	ōr iṉa+ poruḷi oru vaḻi vippatu 
3.	ōttu ena moḻipa uyarmoḻi+ pulavar. 

 
## 	{SA TP473i} 	{N ceyyu-164} 	 
1.	oru neṟi iṉṟi viraviya poruḷāṉ 
2.	potu moḻi toṭariṉ atu paṭalam ākum. 

 
## 	{SA TP474i} 	{N ceyyu-165} 	 
1.	mūṉṟu uṟuppu aṭakkiya taṉmittu āyiṉ 
2.	tōṉṟu moḻi+ pulavar atu piṇṭam eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TP475i} 	{N ceyyu-166} 	 
1.	pāṭṭu iṭi vitta kuṟippiṉāṉum 
2.	pā iṉṟu eḻunta kiḷaviyāṉum 
3.	poruḷ marapu illā+ poymmoḻiyāṉum 
4.	poruḷoṭu puṇarnta nakimoḻiyāṉum eṉṟu 
5.	uri vaki naṭiyē nāṉku eṉa moḻipa. 

 
## 	{SA TP476i} 	{N ceyyu-167} 	 
1.	atuvētāṉum iru vakittu ākum. 

 
## 	{SA TP477i} 	{N ceyyu-168} 	 
1.	oṉṟē maṟṟum cevilikku urittē 
2.	oṉṟē yārkkum vari nili iṉṟē. 

 
## 	{SA TP478i} 	{N ceyyu-169} 	 
1.	oppoṭu puṇarnta uvamattāṉum 
2.	tōṉṟuvatu kiḷanta tuṇiviṉāṉum 
3.	eṉṟu iru vakittē pici nili vakiyē. 

 
## 	{SA TP479i} 	{N ceyyu-170} 	 
1.	nuṇmiyum curukkamum oḷiyuṭimiyum 
2.	eṇmiyum eṉṟu ivi viḷaṅka+ tōṉṟi 
3.	kuṟitta poruḷi muṭittaṟku varūum 
4.	ētu nutaliya mutumoḻi eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TP480i} 	{N ceyyu-171} 	 
1.	niṟimoḻi māntar āṇiyiṉ kiḷakkum 
2.	maṟimoḻitāṉē mantiram eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TP481i} 	{N ceyyu-172} 	 
1.	eḻuttoṭum colloṭum puṇarātāki 
2.	poruṭpuṟattatuvē kuṟippu moḻiyē. 

 
## 	{SA TP482i} 	{N ceyyu-173} 	 
1.	pāṭṭiṭi+ kalanta poruḷa āki 
2.	pāṭṭiṉ iyala paṇṇattiyyē. 

 
## 	{SA TP483i} 	{N ceyyu-174} 	 
1.	atuvētāṉum piciyoṭu māṉum. 

 
## 	{SA TP484i} 	{N ceyyu-175} 	 
1.	aṭi nimir kiḷavi īr-āṟu ākum 
2.	aṭi ikantu variṉum kaṭi vari iṉṟē. 

 
## 	{SA TP485i} 	{N ceyyu-176} 	 
1.	kiḷar iyal vakiyiṉ kiḷantaṉa teriyiṉ 
2.	aḷaviyal vakiyē aṉi vakippaṭumē. 

 
## 	{SA TP486i} 	{N ceyyu-177} 	 
1.	kikkiḷi mutalā ēḻ perun tiṇiyum 
2.	muṉ kiḷantaṉavē muṟiyiṉāṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TP487i} 	{N ceyyu-178} 	 
1.	kāma+ puṇarcciyum iṭam talippaṭalum 
2.	pāṅkoṭu taḻāalum tōḻiyiṉ puṇarvum eṉṟu 
3.	āṅka nāl vakiyiṉum aṭinta cārpoṭu 
4.	maṟi eṉa moḻital maṟiyōr āṟē. 

 
## 	{SA TP488i} 	{N ceyyu-179} 	 
1.	maṟi veḷippaṭutalum tamariṉ peṟutalum 
2.	ivi mutalākiya iyal neṟi tiriyātu 
3.	malivum pulaviyum ūṭalum uṇarvum 
4.	pirivoṭu puṇarntatu kaṟpu eṉappaṭumē. 

 
## 	{SA TP489i} 	{N ceyyu-180} 	 
1.	mey peṟum aviyē kikōḷ vakiyē. 

 
## 	{SA TP490i} 	{N ceyyu-181} 	 
1.	pārppāṉ pāṅkaṉ tōḻi cevili 
2.	cīrttaku ciṟappiṉ kiḻavaṉ kiḻattiyoṭu 
3.	aḷavu iyal marapiṉ aṟu vakiyōrum 
4.	kaḷaviṉ kiḷavikku uriyar eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TP491i} 	{N ceyyu-182} 	 
1.	pāṇaṉ kūttaṉ viṟali paratti 
2.	āṇam cāṉṟa aṟivar kaṇṭōr 
3.	pēṇutaku ciṟappiṉ pārppāṉ mutalā 
4.	muṉṉuṟa+ kiḷanta aṟuvaroṭu tokii 
5.	tol neṟi marapiṉ kaṟpiṟku uriyar. 

 
## 	{SA TP492i} 	{N ceyyu-183} 	 
1.	ūrum ayalum cēriyōrum 
2.	nōy maruṅku aṟinarum tantiyum taṉṉiyum 
